  "notes_2024": "Edition: 'DENTAL GENERAL FEE SCHEDULE JANUARY 1, 2024' (Florida Administrative Code reference Ref-16999, https://www.flrules.org/gateway/reference.asp?No=Ref-16999), the edition dated for calendar 2024 and next superseded by the 2025 schedule. Caveat: it was formally adopted into Rule 59G-4.002 by the amendment effective 10/21/2024; the rule version legally in force on 2024-07-01 (effective 12/31/2023) incorporated the 'Dental General Fee Schedule 2023' (Ref-16119, January 1, 2023), which has identical child and adult rates for all 53 requested codes present (checked code by code). AHCA applies schedules by their printed effective date, so the January 1, 2024 edition is used. Parsed by column position: 0-20 Year Rate -> child, 21+ Year Rate -> adult (blank = no adult rate). Prior authorization Y on dentures, D5820/D5821 and ortho codes."
